The Situation Room is a radio news programme on 101.2 WSTR. It airs in the evening, when people are heading home from work, and gathers the day's stories.

It is hosted by Bev Sirnow and Chuck Vessler. Chuck is introduced on air as the constantly indicted Chuck Vessler, and he reads the show's sponsors himself. Its guests have included Major-Chaplain [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Ewan McFoster|Ewan McFoster]] of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/index|Magical Crimes Convox]], who blamed the endless rain over [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] on illegal [[Phenomena/Augury|augury]].
